{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國創立、總部位於新加坡的快時尚電商平台希音（Shein）同意支付1億美元，以解決美國聯邦貿易委員會（FTC）針對其物流延誤及其他消費者投訴展開的調查。路透社10月23日報道稱，這筆和解款相當於希音第二季度利潤的44%，反映出該公司在美國和歐洲面臨的監管壓力正在增加。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583610.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.033202+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:17:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_hash":"6ad4a857bdf3b0fc96d3cc6f2e201ebedb2d73c782ddded42fe22d95c522e9e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}